     8574     field isMarking   as logical
     8575     field isArtic     as logical
     8576     field isWeight    as logical
     8577     field isVarWeight as logical
     8578     field isSelect    as logical
     8579     field markType    as character
     8580     field PieceTTH    as character
     8581     field PieceFact   as character
     8582     index pi  db-num doc-id LineNum
     8583     index gds-code gds-code
