     8589     field sts-utd     as integer
     8590     field stts-utd    as character
     8591     field unit        as character
     8592     field unit-ext    as character
     8593     field site        as character
     8594     field box-qnty    as decimal
     8595     field gds-name    as character
     8596     field db-num      as integer
     8597     field doc-id      as integer
     8598     field LineNum     as integer
     8599     field GrayZone    as logical
     8600     field isMark      as logical
     8601     field isWeight    as logical
     8602     field marking-string as character
     8603     field old-sts     as integer
     8604     field weight      as character
     8605     index pi  doc-level   sts
     8606     index pi2 mark-parent sts
     8607     index pi3 unit-ext
     8608     index pi4 mark obj-type obj-code gds-code in-code out-code part-code prt-code
     8609     index part gds-code obj-type obj-code in-code out-code part-code prt-code
     8610     index gds-code gds-code
     8611     index obj obj-code obj-type
     8612     .
     8613   define temp-table tt-mark-line like ub.marking-lines
